    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/1/51786.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 76,
    "turn_text": "Out of front now, a former Republican congressman, Will Hurd, who represented the Uvaldi community for six years in Congress, and Paul Bagala, former White House counsel to President Clinton, and our political commentator. Congressman Hurd, just to state the obvious, you know, Marco Rubio often has very thoughtful things to say, but to say that someone with a knife instead of a gun could go in and murder and slaughter 21 people, it's not right. So when you hear Trump, other Republicans heading to Texas for the NRA meeting, Trump confirming today. So there's on Capitol Hill. Many of them find ways to dismiss ideas for gun control. What do you say to them?",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_27",
