      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker expects Congressman Hurd to take a critical stance toward Republican opposition to gun control.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience values reasoned discourse on public policy issues.",
        "confidence": 0.87
